+"""Admin service package — cross-tenant read-only lookups for system_admin operators.
+
+This package holds the DB-only service layer (errors, models, query functions)
+for admin tooling. It NEVER reads ``app.current_tenant_id`` — all functions
+take an ``asyncpg.Connection`` obtained from ``system_tx`` so queries run
+without a tenant GUC. Visibility is gated at the tool layer (AdminTool base)
+via ``has_permission``.
+"""
